        {
          "book": "ROM",
          "chapter": 4,
          "verse": 15
        }
      ],
      "en": "For the law produces wrath; for where there is no law, neither is there disobedience.",
      "ko": "율법은 진노를 이루게 하나니 율법이 없는 곳에는 범함도 없느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "66ab1c190e140d39ab451db10fd92f1d38b4b163424be6efa911d0603707b6b8",
      "translation_text_hash": "a3b70498c910dc5d569b902b276a707a62a92054ea1896872cda9ef25307d845",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
