      "en": "Yet, looking to the promise of God, he didn’t waver through unbelief, but grew strong through faith, giving glory to God,",
      "ko": "믿음이 없어 하나님의 약속을 의심치 않고 믿음에 견고하여져서 하나님께 영광을 돌리며",
      "source_text_hash": "442368313b4c5a2d7bb29f5302425796cf117ac0757c12473a509a2dff6b9275",
      "translation_text_hash": "c2a3f4117dd96f8f5b89485e04180e4750062232dbb3a8993514dca93a048a1a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
